files are third-party works under their own licence.

They are Citation Style Language styles from the Zotero Style Repository,
https://www.zotero.org/styles. Each is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License,
http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/. Their authors and
contributors are listed in each file. They are shipped unmodified and are
used by render_report() to format the References section, chosen by
render_report(csl = ). surveyframe never fetches a style from the network.

inst/csl/apa.csl
  "APA Style 7th edition", http://www.zotero.org/styles/apa, last updated
  2026-02-07. The default, csl = "apa".

inst/csl/chicago-author-date.csl
  "Chicago Manual of Style 18th edition (author-date)",
  http://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-author-date, last updated 2025-02-09.
  csl = "chicago-author-date".

inst/csl/harvard-cite-them-right.csl
  "Cite Them Right 12th edition (author-date/Harvard)",
  http://www.zotero.org/styles/harvard-cite-them-right, last updated
  2026-02-12. csl = "harvard".

inst/csl/ieee.csl
  "IEEE Reference Guide version 11.29.2023", http://www.zotero.org/styles/ieee,
  last updated 2024-03-27. csl = "ieee".

inst/csl/modern-language-association.csl
  "MLA Handbook 9th edition (in-text citations)",
  http://www.zotero.org/styles/modern-language-association, last updated
  2026-02-03. csl = "mla".

The 4 styles other than APA were copied from QuartoPad's inst/csl/ at commit
5a5e30095b0659149d57d0891ebeb5aaa8b723b8.
